OL,5,G0505 Dermot's Taste of Ireland
OL,6,     FOn the sweeping sands of Benone
OL,7,     FStrand in Co Derry, Dermot O'Leary
OL,8,     Frolls up his trousers and wades
OL,9,     Finto the sea to harvest water for
OL,10,     Fsalt-making, learning the
OL,11,     Ftraditional process of creating
OL,12,     Fsea salt over an open fire right
OL,13,     Fon the beach. Travelling on to
OL,14,     FColeraine, Dermot tries lobster
OL,15,     Ffishing and visits LIR seafood
OL,16,     Frestaurant, where the chefs
OL,17,     Fchampion a zero-waste approach to
OL,18,     Fcooking
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
