OL,5,G0530 Gary Barlow's Food and Wine Tour:
OL,6,G     New Zealand
OL,7,     FGary and Jason Manford leave the
OL,8,     Fcamper van behind and board the
OL,9,     FCoastal Pacific train for one of
OL,10,     FNew Zealand's great railway
OL,11,     Fjourneys. They take in epic views
OL,12,     Fof the Pacific, keeping an eye out
OL,13,     Ffor penguins and dolphins, before
OL,14,     Farriving in Blenheim, in the heart
OL,15,     Fof Marlborough wine country, where
OL,16,     Fthey ride through the vineyards on
OL,17,     Fa tandem. After a day of
OL,18,     Fcoastlines, fine wines and
OL,19,     Fquestionable teamwork, Gary and
OL,20,     FJason climb back into the camper
OL,21,     Fvan and continue their road trip
OL,22,     Fthrough Marlborough
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
